// cases_a.js -- A: MAKE STATION blocks written the ways small and large models write them (right ones above all), built
// by Lantern (aiAct.build) and judged whole: the control circuit simulated (lib.js / sim.js: the lead float starts one
// pump, held in to the off float, the pumps take turns, the lag float runs both, the alarm light only at the alarm
// float, an overload drops only its pump), the piping (each pump with its check valve and then its shutoff valve), the
// float levels (the station's floats, in order, to scale when heights are given), the parts list against the drawings,
// how it works and the checks against the floats drawn, and every default said.
